OL,3,ANursery owner in China jailed for life
OL,4,Aafter hundreds of children poisoned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nursery owner and five members of her
OL,7,Fstaff have been jailed after they were
OL,8,Ffound to have poisoned more than 200
OL,9,Fchildren with lead-tainted food.
OL,11,FLi Huifang, who operated the Heshi
OL,12,FPeixin Kindergarten in Tianshui, in the
OL,13,FGansu province, was sentenced to life
OL,14,Fin prison for producing and selling
OL,15,Ftoxic and harmful food, according to
OL,16,FChinese state media.
OL,18,FIn July 2025, 247 pupils and staff at
OL,19,Fthe nursery were found to have
OL,20,Fabnormally high blood lead levels after
OL,21,Fchildren began falling ill.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
