OL,3,ANursery owner in China jailed for life
OL,4,Aafter hundreds of children poisoned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report into the incident found that
OL,7,Fchefs at Heshi Peixin had used inedible
OL,8,Fpaint to "enhance the look" of its
OL,9,Fmeals to attract more students -
OL,10,Fdespite the paint being being clearly
OL,11,Fmarked as such.
